{"id":"14670fcc367c76d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-block-theory.md","title":"Block Theory","display":"df-block-theory — Block Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-block-theory","aliases":["58-df-block-theory","Block Theory"],"display":"df-block-theory — Block Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-block-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-block-theory</span><span>Block Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-block-theory — Block Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e\\in V\\)</span> (field, finite group, characteristic, length, and idempotent sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are predicates from dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land|G|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land p\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{char}(k)=p\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall f\\in k[x]\\;\\bigl(\\deg(f)&gt;0\\to\\exists a\\in k\\;(f(a)=0_k)\\bigr)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,n+1,Z(kG))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\sum_{i\\leq n}e(i)=1_{kG}\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\Bigl(e(i)^2=e(i)\\land\\neg\\exists a,b\\in Z(kG)\\;(a,b\\neq0\\land a^2=a\\land b^2=b\\land ab=0\\land e(i)=a+b)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\leq n\\;(e(i)e(j)=0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land|G|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land p\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{char}(k)=p\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall f\\in k[x]\\;\\bigl(\\deg(f)&gt;0\\to\\exists a\\in k\\;(f(a)=0_k)\\bigr)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,n+1,Z(kG))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\sum_{i\\leq n}e(i)=1_{kG}\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\Bigl(e(i)^2=e(i)\\land\\neg\\exists a,b\\in Z(kG)\\;(a,b\\neq0\\land a^2=a\\land b^2=b\\land ab=0\\land e(i)=a+b)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\leq n\\;(e(i)e(j)=0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S(k,G,e)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\cdot_G,p,n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S(k,G,e)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\cdot_G,p,n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Block: a primitive-central-idempotent decomposition of the group algebra; all field, group, characteristic, and sequence-length data are explicitly bound.</li>\n<li>The associated two-sided ideals are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kGe_i\">\\(kGe_i\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kG=\\bigoplus_{i\\leq n}kGe_i\">\\(kG=\\bigoplus_{i\\leq n}kGe_i\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Navarro, Blocks and Characters of Finite Groups</li>\n<li>Kessar and Malle, Local-Global Conjectures</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land|G|<\\aleph_0\\land p\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{char}(k)=p\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall f\\in k[x]\\;\\bigl(\\deg(f)>0\\to\\exists a\\in k\\;(f(a)=0_k)\\bigr)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,n+1,Z(kG))\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\sum_{i\\leq n}e(i)=1_{kG}\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\Bigl(e(i)^2=e(i)\\land\\neg\\exists a,b\\in Z(kG)\\;(a,b\\neq0\\land a^2=a\\land b^2=b\\land ab=0\\land e(i)=a+b)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall i<j\\leq n\\;(e(i)e(j)=0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}block\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{BlockDecomp}_S(k,G,e)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\cdot_G,p,n\\in V\\;\\mathrm{BlockDecompStructure}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,G,\\cdot_G,p,n,e)","display":true},{"tex":"kGe_i","display":false},{"tex":"kG=\\bigoplus_{i\\leq n}kGe_i","display":false}],"bytes":2009,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d8f17dcaa965ccb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depen